 athletics and grades are average. However, because he doesn't know the meaning of depressed and has an incredibly cheerful attitude, and the only time he ever cried was when his childhood friend Horizon Ariadust died. He knows a lot of strip jokes, and often plays the fool but he's very respected nonetheless."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c88294"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/ad7eaf80a20cbd37bb8dc2cd6706b1cf3cc6680107f1497b19df50ee2f5b25a1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5cf330098dbcf0cbb41bab6376f5fb4f705d1c50c455581bae6fdbc752bedbcb.webp","width":255,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"福山 潤","creatorId":"vndb:s393","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s393","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s393","name":"福山潤","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:53698","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c88295","characterName":"ホライゾン・アリアダスト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c88295"},"originalCharacterName":"ホライゾン・アリアダスト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is an android employed at the bakery/snack shop Blue Thunder, which is popular among the Musashi students. She aimlessly appeared one year ago and the owner of Blue Thunder took her in, but she has no memories prior to that. She is emotionless and unsociable, but she works very hard at Blue Thunder. She is also the reason why Tori started going back to the Blue Thunder, because she resembled Horizon, Tori's childhood friend and love interest who supposedly died ten years earlier."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c88295"}],"profileFacts":[],"meta